    "intro_narrative": "The alarms of Station Tartarus blare in a relentless rhythm, casting the central command nexus in a harsh, pulsing red light. The facility has been locked down due to an imminent core meltdown, and all evacuation shuttles have long since departed. You are the last technician remaining on board, trapped in the heart of the station's tangled mainframe. Your only chance of escape is to override the lockdown protocols, but the master override codes are tightly sealed within the Final Datacore. The station's systems have fragmented, turning the command center into a complex web of encrypted terminals, biometric locks, and dead-end data flows. You must navigate this maze of futuristic technology, reactivating dormant modules and tracing the scattered data to piece together the command sequence. Time is running dangerously low. Reactivate the systems, follow the data trails, and extract the codes before the station is reduced to stardust.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
